# The last round closing in, in lunges (game/rounds.h). Film it with
# tests\e2e\film_round.ps1 -Round 5 -Steps closing.steps. Rides fast north to near the north wall,
# turns along it, and shoots through a lunge: iso first (the wall sliding in beside the cycle),
# then 1st person looking left at it (the camera rumbles while it moves). The debug text's
# "arena" is the square's width: it drops by 1000 a lunge.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at the round's start
# START, Z, START: a crash only stops the cycle (NOTERM), so the shots go on whatever hits it
press start
press z
press start
wait 0.5
# C x6: cruise 7 -> 13
press c 6
wait 6.2
press right
press down
wait 1.2
shot close_00
wait 0.3
shot close_01
wait 0.3
